[gd_scene format=3]
; One variable: a closed BEVEL Line2D whose width_curve is 0 at its start. Godot's 1 / 0 weight makes
; the first pair NaN (line_builder.cpp:316), so the closing segment draws nothing and the left side of
; the square stays open. No other scene closes a line whose width curve starts at 0.

